plasma-bigscreen (6.7.2-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  [ Aurélien COUDERC ]
  * Add/update Bhushan Shah’s key in upstream keyring.
  * New upstream release (6.7.2).
  * Drop now unnecessary patch.
  * Build against Qt6, update build-deps and deps with the info from cmake.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4, no change required.
  * Drop Rules-Requires-Root: no, not needed anymore since trixie.
  * Drop Priority: optional, not needed anymore since dpkg 1.22.13.
  * Refresh copyright information.
  * Add binary package for qml6-module-org-kde-bigscreen module.
  * Recommend libkf6kcmutils-bin and systemsettings, needed to launch the
    KCMs.

 -- Aurélien COUDERC <coucouf@debian.org>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 08:00:47 +0200

